eue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">深度求索DeepSeek聘请中信证券筹备科创板IPO，估值目标5000亿元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与三星电子深化合作，正联合研发下一代AI计算芯片</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta推出个人AI智能体Muse，基于云端虚拟机运行并支持多平台接入</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini每日简报功能正式向全球免费用户全面开放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日宣布，旗下AI助手Gemini的“每日简报”功能正式向所有免费订阅用户开放，此前该功能仅限于Google AI Plus、Pro或Ultra等付费用户使用。该功能旨在通过每日清晨生成高度凝练的综合摘要，帮助用户快速梳理待办事项、盘点未回复邮件及关键信息，显著提升早间信息处理效率。目前，该功能已支持网页端及移动端App，并率先在美国地区上线，后续将逐步推广至全球。谷歌官方透露，未来将为每日简报增加音频播放选项，使用户能以收听播客的形式获取信息，进一步丰富交互体验。此次功能下放标志着谷歌正通过降低AI工具使用门槛，加速提升Gemini在免费用户群体中的渗透率与日常使用粘性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁开源124B参数原生多模态大模型Ling-3.0-flash-VL</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁开源团队正式发布百灵系列首个原生多模态大模型Ling-3.0-flash-VL。该模型基于Ling-3.0-flash的MoE架构构建，总参数量达124B，单次推理激活5.5B参数，支持图像、文本与视频输入，上下文窗口达256K Token。研发实践表明，原生多模态联合训练不仅拓展了应用边界，还进一步提升了文本智能。模型引入创新视觉反馈机制，通过“观察、对比、修正”的闭环流程，将传统一次性生成转变为具备自我纠错能力的动态过程，显著增强了任务执行的可靠性。作为Agent工作流中的高效执行节点，Ling-3.0-flash-VL在兼顾输出质量与执行效率的同时，能以更低成本和更短时间完成复杂任务，为开发者提供更具竞争力的多模态解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">深度求索DeepSeek聘请中信证券筹备科创板IPO，估值目标5000亿元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a9d6ed61bca0e37f74e8e69b006cbedb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">深度求索DeepSeek已正式聘请中信证券筹备国内科创板IPO，计划年内递交申请并于明年挂牌。公司2026年前七个月营收约4.75亿元，约为2025年全年的十倍。此次IPO募资将重点投向算力基础设施建设、大模型与芯片自研及人才激励。DeepSeek目前正推进新一轮融资，目标估值达5000亿元人民币。此前6月，公司完成74亿美元首轮融资，投后估值超3364亿元，股东阵容包括腾讯、宁德时代、京东、网易及国家人工智能产业投资基金等。针对市场出现的SPV二级交易乱象，创始人梁文锋已介入审核投资者名单，以规避股权结构风险。该融资轮次设置了五年锁定期且外部投资者不享有投票权。随着上市进程加速，DeepSeek正通过强化股权治理，确保公司商业化落地与资本运作的合规性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与三星电子深化合作，正联合研发下一代AI计算芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7d4a81a560f335c6409efbec5d647267.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI韩国区总经理Harrison Kim在新闻发布会上确认，公司正与三星电子在下一代芯片的联合生产与研究领域展开深度合作。该合作旨在应对AI模型对更快速、更复杂计算能力的迫切需求，并重点关注存储芯片技术的升级。Kim强调，随着计算需求的演进，与韩国半导体供应商的协作已成为OpenAI当地办事处的战略优先事项。此外，三星电子目前已是全球范围内应用ChatGPT规模最大的企业之一，其全球员工在研发、市场营销及销售等多个业务环节中广泛部署了ChatGPT。此次合作不仅标志着OpenAI在底层硬件布局上的进一步深化，也反映了AI头部厂商与存储芯片巨头在算力基础设施层面的深度绑定，对未来AI硬件生态的演进具有重要行业参考意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta推出个人AI智能体Muse，基于云端虚拟机运行并支持多平台接入</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布个人AI智能体Muse，该产品由Muse Spark 1.3模型驱动，运行于专用云端虚拟机，支持后台持续执行任务。Muse即将面向美国18岁以上用户开放，覆盖iOS、安卓、网页端及WhatsApp，未来将集成至Instagram、Facebook及Meta AI眼镜。Muse具备主动建议与任务执行能力，已接入Ticketmaster、OpenTable及谷歌服务。隐私方面，Meta承诺Muse数据不与广告系统共享，且敏感操作需用户确认。产品提供免费版及每月20美元、100美元的付费套餐，旨在通过云端算力为用户提供“第二大脑”式的辅助。Meta首席AI官Alexandr Wang强调其易用性，未来计划向旗下社交平台超36亿日活用户推广。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
